Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:23.95,Kicker,,0,0,0,,What If You Woke Up As... · Ep 2
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:23.95,Title,,0,0,0,,YOU STUBBED YOUR TOE.\NNOW THERE'S NO BED.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:01.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(40,40)}TODAY YOU WOKE UP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.03,0:00:01.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(40,40)}AS THE HULK.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.21,0:00:03.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(40,40)}YOU KNOW THIS BECAUSE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.03,0:00:04.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(40,40)}YOU STUBBED YOUR TOE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.35,0:00:06.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(40,40)}AND NOW THERE
