Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.76,0:00:09.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(40,40)}IT LASTS ABOUT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.50,0:00:10.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(40,40)}TEN SECONDS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.02,0:00:11.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(40,40)}THE BED DOES
